Greg's decision (2026-11-22 ~06:53Z, relayed verbatim by Engram::Asistant, TermAl mailbox 588693a8 #2521): „po poprawce pamieci mozemy wszystko wznowic” ("after the memory fix we can resume everything").
Meaning for the TermAl coordinator: the hold on TermAl work ("prace Engram i Termal sa chwilowo wstrzymane", 2026-11-21) LIFTS once the memory fix w-b3c1cd1bcea1 has landed and is installed, together with the one agreed restart if needed, which Greg performs at the moment the coordinators propose.
Resume order proposed to Greg (Fable2 #2520):
(a) federation: w-e42f6b850a2d (record drop reasons), w-15752bc88638 (auto-recovery; carry candidate 0d7db98c), then the cause fix;
(b) w-e2972bb21221 (state-lock holds);
(c) w-4483f709da27 (orphaned delegation processes);
(d) w-d2982d6f0d3f (Engram not reaching a loaded Codex thread);
(e) the in-module include! fragments (88; item to be filed);
(f) disk sweeps w-b92d241c0154 and w-a0803adfb50c;
(g) the older queue (Wave A/B, w-7e4f and the rest).
Before then, only Greg's explicit exceptions run: the include! work (Fable52), the memory fix (Opus3), checks, Comovo and Legal.
